#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:367
#: 6e80a9f4509447cdb74eaf95f2c555df
msgid "Simulating Multiple Flight Controllers on a Vehicle"
msgstr "在飞行器上仿真多个飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:369
#: a37aa0ee87e74ca49e8a4abef0b785e4
msgid ""
"The STANDBY Mode function (``RCx_OPTION`` = 76) allows an autopilot to be"
" put into a soft standby mode so that a second autopilot or companion "
"computer can take control, but allow the first to resume later. In order "
"to help in the code development of such systems, you can simulate two "
"flight controllers operating in the simulation at the same time. The "
"\"master\" instance, which has the active outputs into the sim is started"
" declaring that there will be a \"slave\" instance which will be "
"monitoring the sensors and running its code in parallel, but whose "
"outputs are not connected into the simulation physics:"
msgstr ""
"待机模式功能（``RCx_OPTION`` = "
"76）允许将飞控置于软待机模式，以便第二个飞控或伴飞计算机接管控制，同时允许第一个稍后恢复。为了协助此类系统的代码开发，您可以在仿真中同时模拟两个飞控运行。「主」实例具有向仿真输出的活动输出，在声明有「从」实例存在的情况下启动，从实例将并行监控传感器并运行其代码，但其输出未连接到仿真物理引擎："

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:375
#: 0518ddd7111f43869ba72438141f9831
msgid "then another sim is started for the \"slave\" autopilot using:"
msgstr "然后使用以下命令为「从」飞控启动另一个仿真："

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:381
#: ec5dcb019a3f482184a1a5ef76a8251a
msgid ""
"you can then switch between whose outputs are being used by the "
"simulation physics with the ``SIM_JSON_MASTER`` parameter  ie O or 1."
msgstr "然后您可以使用 ``SIM_JSON_MASTER`` 参数（即 0 或 1）切换仿真物理引擎使用哪个实例的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/adding_simulated_devices.rst:383
#: 5e029162610c45d29c60e90ce469b8a1
